);


--
-- Name: COLUMN "expenses"."company_id"; Type: COMMENT; Schema: company_os; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN "company_os"."expenses"."company_id" IS 'The client this expense was incurred for, when it was incurred for one. Ours, not QuickBooks'':
   the expense itself is mirrored and the sync owns every other column, but the attribution to a
   client is set here (by the per-transaction sync once it lands, or by hand in the admin) and is
   what the Revenue hub''s delivery-cost and gross-margin figures read. Null means unattributed,
   which the Data health tab counts and the margin card reports as unknown cost rather than
   silently treating as zero.';


